WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:10.120
Part three: act for a volunteer. When someone can't do it themselves, you can update their info, upload their paperwork, or name their spots for them.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:15.600
On a volunteer's admin page, tap Update their info, slash paperwork.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.740
Name spots for them works the same way, for spots that still need a name.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:29.740
The page opens with a brown banner: your name, who you're working for, and a reminder that everything you submit is stamped and logged.

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:35.253
It's their paperwork page, exactly as they see it: what's on file, and when it runs out.

00:00:35.453 --> 00:00:40.030
Fix their contact info, shirt size, programs, or students.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:46.385
Open a document section to upload paperwork they gave you, like a paper Levy packet.

00:00:46.585 --> 00:00:51.748
Tap Submit. The upload is marked as yours, and every log line ends with your name.

00:00:51.948 --> 00:00:57.830
Done? Tap Back to admin portal. These admin links stop working when your sign-in ends.
